-     $$ worldX = x + xOffset $$
-     $$ worldY = y + yOffset $$
-     $$ worldZ = z + zOffset $$
-   [S1, unofficial].
-   - Check the six neighboring voxels (left, right, top, bottom, front, rear) [S1, unofficial].
